\""},{"id":"cne_j094_q3","topicId":"cne_j094","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"她没有去湖边。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"She didn't went to the lake."},{"key":"B","text":"She didn't go to the lake."},{"key":"C","text":"She doesn't went to the lake."},{"key":"D","text":"She didn't goes to the lake."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"didn't 后面用原形 go。","verify":"\"She didn't go to the lake.\""},{"id":"cne_j094_q4","topicId":"cne_j094","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"What did you do last weekend? 这句在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"上周末你将做什么"},{"key":"B","text":"你周末通常做什么"},{"key":"C","text":"上周末你做了什么"},{"key":"D","text":"你正在做什么"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"did 加过去时间问已经做的事。","verify":"\"上周末你做了什么\""},{"id":"cne_j095_q1","topicId":"cne_j095","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"go 的过去式是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"went"},{"key":"B","text":"goed"},{"key":"C","text":"goes"},{"key":"D","text":"going"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"go 的过去式是 went。","verify":"\"went\""},{"id":"cne_j095_q2","topicId":"cne_j095","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"see 的过去式是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"seed"},{"key":"B","text":"saw"},{"key":"C","text":"seen"},{"key":"D","text":"sawed"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"see 的过去式是 saw。","verify":"\"saw\""},{"id":"cne_j095_q3","topicId":"cne_j095","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"read 的过去式和原形拼写一样。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I readed an interesting book last night."},{"key":"B","text":"I reads an interesting book last night."},{"key":"C","text":"I read an interesting book last night."},{"key":"D","text":"I reading an interesting book last night."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"read 的过去式仍拼作 read，不写成 readed。","verify":"\"I read an interesting book last night.\""},{"id":"cne_j095_q4","topicId":"cne_j095","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"我们过得很愉快。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"We haved a good time."},{"key":"B","text":"We has a good time yesterday."},{"key":"C","text":"We had have a good time."},{"key":"D","text":"We had a good time."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"have 的过去式是 had。","verify":"\"We had a good time.\""},{"id":"cne_j096_q1","topicId":"cne_j096","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问对方上周末做了什么，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"What did you did last weekend?"},{"key":"B","text":"What did you do last weekend?"},{"key":"C","text":"What do you do last weekend?"},{"key":"D","text":"What did you last weekend?"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"What did you do。","verify":"\"What did you do last weekend?\""},{"id":"cne_j096_q2","topicId":"cne_j096","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"你去了海滩，应怎么说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I goed to the beach."},{"key":"B","text":"I go to the beach last weekend."},{"key":"C","text":"I went to the beach."},{"key":"D","text":"I went to the beach yesterday now."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"went 是 go 的过去式。","verify":"\"I went to the beach.\""},{"id":"cne_j096_q3","topicId":"cne_j096","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Who did you go with? 这句在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"你去了哪里"},{"key":"B","text":"你怎么去的"},{"key":"C","text":"你星期几去的"},{"key":"D","text":"你和谁一起去的"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"Who ... with 问同伴。","verify":"\"你和谁一起去的\""},{"id":"cne_j096_q4","topicId":"cne_j096","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说访客们打了羽毛球，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The visitors played badminton."},{"key":"B","text":"The visitors play badminton last Sunday."},{"key":"C","text":"The visitors were played badminton."},{"key":"D","text":"The visitors plaied badminton."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"played 是 play 的过去式。","verify":"\"The visitors played badminton.\""},{"id":"cne_j097_q1","topicId":"cne_j097","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"On Saturday morning I went to the lake with my father. We went fishing. 星期六上午他和谁去的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他的妈妈"},{"key":"B","text":"同学"},{"key":"C","text":"他的爸爸"},{"key":"D","text":"游客"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"with my father。","verify":"\"他的爸爸\""},{"id":"cne_j097_q2","topicId":"cne_j097","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"On Saturday morning I went to the lake with my father. We went fishing. 他们做了什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"打羽毛球"},{"key":"B","text":"去海滩"},{"key":"C","text":"参观农场"},{"key":"D","text":"钓鱼"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"went fishing。","verify":"\"钓鱼\""},{"id":"cne_j097_q3","topicId":"cne_j097","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"On Sunday Lisa stayed at home and read a book. She did not play badminton. 她打羽毛球了吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"没有"},{"key":"B","text":"打了"},{"key":"C","text":"和爸爸打了"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"did not play badminton。","verify":"\"没有\""},{"id":"cne_j097_q4","topicId":"cne_j097","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"On Sunday Lisa stayed at home and read a book. 哪一句和日记一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Lisa went to the lake on Sunday."},{"key":"B","text":"Lisa read at home on Sunday."},{"key":"C","text":"Lisa played badminton."},{"key":"D","text":"Lisa did not read."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"stayed at home and read a book。","verify":"\"Lisa read at home on Sunday.\""},{"id":"cne_j163_q1","topicId":"cne_j163","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「皇帝」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"emperor"},{"key":"B","text":"stupid"},{"key":"C","text":"stone"},{"key":"D","text":"weak"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"emperor 的意思是皇帝。","verify":"\"emperor\""},{"id":"cne_j163_q2","topicId":"cne_j163","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「stupid」的中文意思是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"皇帝"},{"key":"B","text":"愚蠢的"},{"key":"C","text":"石头"},{"key":"D","text":"虚弱的"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"stupid 的意思是愚蠢的。","verify":"\"愚蠢的\""},{"id":"cne_j163_q3","topicId":"cne_j163","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择表示「石头」的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"emperor"},{"key":"B","text":"stupid"},{"key":"C","text":"stone"},{"key":"D","text":"weak"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"表示石头的单词是 stone。","verify":"\"stone\""},{"id":"cne_j163_q4","topicId":"cne_j163","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「虚弱的」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"emperor"},{"key":"B","text":"stupid"},{"key":"C","text":"stone"},{"key":"D","text":"weak"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"weak 的意思是虚弱的。","verify":"\"weak\""},{"id":"cne_j166_q1","topicId":"cne_j166","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"故事开头，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Once upon a time, there is an old man yesterday."},{"key":"B","text":"Once upon a time, there were an old man."},{"key":"C","text":"Once upon a time, there was a old man."},{"key":"D","text":"Once upon a time, there was an old man."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"there was an old man。","verify":"\"Once upon a time, there was an old man.\""},{"id":"cne_j166_q2","topicId":"cne_j166","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"老人一直试着移山。哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The old man kept trying to move the mountain."},{"key":"B","text":"The old man kept try to move the mountain."},{"key":"C","text":"The old man kept to trying move the mountain."},{"key":"D","text":"The old man kept trying move the mountain."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"kept trying to move。","verify":"\"The old man kept trying to move the mountain.\""},{"id":"cne_j166_q3","topicId":"cne_j166","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"别人觉得这很愚蠢，应怎么说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Other people thought it is stupid yesterday."},{"key":"B","text":"Other people thought it was stupid."},{"key":"C","text":"Other people think it was stupid now past."},{"key":"D","text":"Other people thought it were stupid."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"thought it was stupid。","verify":"\"Other people thought it was stupid.\""},{"id":"cne_j166_q4","topicId":"cne_j166","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说他没有放弃，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"He did not gave up."},{"key":"B","text":"He did not giving up."},{"key":"C","text":"He did not give up."},{"key":"D","text":"He not gave up."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"did not give up。","verify":"\"He did not give up.\""},{"id":"cne_j167_q1","topicId":"cne_j167","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"An old man tried to move the mountains. His family kept working every day. 老人想做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"移走大山"},{"key":"B","text":"建造宫殿"},{"key":"C","text":"寻找皇帝"},{"key":"D","text":"离开村庄"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"move the mountains。","verify":"\"移走大山\""},{"id":"cne_j167_q2","topicId":"cne_j167","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"An old man tried to move the mountains. His family kept working every day. 家人怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"马上放弃"},{"key":"B","text":"每天继续干活"},{"key":"C","text":"只看不干"},{"key":"D","text":"搬走了"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"kept working every day。","verify":"\"每天继续干活\""},{"id":"cne_j167_q3","topicId":"cne_j167","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"A god thought the man was weak, but he sent two gods to help. 谁来帮忙？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"皇帝"},{"key":"B","text":"邻居"},{"key":"C","text":"两位神"},{"key":"D","text":"没有人"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"two gods to help。","verify":"\"两位神\""},{"id":"cne_j167_q4","topicId":"cne_j167","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"A god thought the man was weak, but he sent two gods to help. 哪一句和故事一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The man gave up at once."},{"key":"B","text":"The family never worked."},{"key":"C","text":"The god refused to help."},{"key":"D","text":"The gods came to help the man."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"sent two gods to help。","verify":"\"The gods came to help the man.\""}]
